    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GP - Audit Page\nAudits **one page**. Called once per page by GP - Audit Orchestrator.\n\n**In:** url, page_type, image_count\n**Out:** one item with rule findings + Claude review for this page\n\nIf the page can't be loaded, this workflow stops with an error. The orchestrator then logs the page in the \"Failed\" tab.",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 528,
        "color": "#A45051"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -32,
        -480
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "38946850-5609-4993-a8ff-7e7650e29662",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Fetch the page\n- Downloads the page HTML (retry 3x, timeout 15 s).\n- **Follow Redirects is off on purpose:** a redirecting URL returns 301 and is logged as failed. Otherwise findings would be filed under the wrong URL.\n- Only status 200 continues. Anything else stops here with a clear error message.\n",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 864,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -48,
        -144
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "e18a00a8-c7e8-43c6-bfd1-f527a473a8df",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Extract SEO fields\nReads title, meta description, canonical, language, H1/H2, structured data (JSON-LD), image alt texts and the main text.\nHeader, footer and navigation are skipped. Text is cleaned and cut to 6,000 characters for Claude.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 656,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        864,
        -144
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "c6612d88-877c-49ae-9171-a50473aaf568",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Review the page\n- **Rule Checks:** 6 fixed rules (title, meta, H1, canonical, structured data, alt text). Same input = same result.\n- **Claude GEO Review:** judges how well the page answers questions an AI assistant would ask. Quotes are checked against the page.\n- **Combine:** merges both results into one item.",
        "height": 656,
        "width": 704,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1568,
        -240
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "595289e4-bf84-4276-a8ea-1ebc3059c329",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    }
